Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:30:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] Add characterization tests for unpaid_invoices

Pin what unpaid_invoices returns today, right or wrong, before refactoring it:
the fixture as it is, a scenario added to a temporary copy of it to reach every
reminder level, kind of customer and edge of the cutoff and of the settled
tolerance, and snapshots of three day and delay pairs on the real database,
skipped without PACHAPLAN_DB.

